Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.20,0:03:16.04,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.72,0:00:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我都招了 - 你他妈全在废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I told you… - You told me shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他们不熟 只是在路上认识的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I barely knew those guys. I met 'em on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.55,0:00:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many in your group?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.45,0:00:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 别这样 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no, no… Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.62,0:00:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,30 30个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, 30… 30. 30 guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.71,0:00:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.74,0:00:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓我真不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从不在一个地方待太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were never anyplace more than a night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.90,0:00:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在侦察吗 准备在这里长住吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scouting? Planning on staying local?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.52,0:00:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 他们把我抛下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I don't know. They… they left me behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.94,0:00:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你被人揭过伤疤吗 - 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you ever pick off a scab? - Come on, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.24,0:01:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在努力配合 - 刚开始可不够配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm-I'm trying to cooperate. - Start real slow at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.09,0:01:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是 - 你迟早都要坦白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Sooner or later, you've just gotta rip it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.48,0:01:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.28,0:01:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have weapons…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.47,0:01:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,重装备 自动步枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heavy stuff, automatics.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.19,0:01:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我什么也没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.96,0:01:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的人试图射杀我们 夺走农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your boys shot at my boys, tried to take this farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.31,0:01:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你只是跟着打酱油吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just went along for the ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.67,0:01:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说自己是无辜的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're trying to tell me you're innocent?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.06,0:01:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.75,0:01:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人收留了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}These… these people took me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.32,0:01:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是男人 他们有一群人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just guys… a whole group of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.15,0:01:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有男有女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men and women,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.07,0:01:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有孩子 就和你们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}kids too… just like you people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.26,0:01:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为跟他们一起生存希望能大一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought I'd have a better chance with them, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.33,0:01:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.20,0:01:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出去 寻找补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go out, scavenge…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.43,0:01:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就几个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the men.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.04,0:01:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天晚上 我们找到了块野营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}One night, we… we found this little campsite.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.42,0:01:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个男人和他的两个女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man and his two daughters…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.78,0:01:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是豆蔻少女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teenagers, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.48,0:01:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常年轻 非常可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real young. Real cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.17,0:02:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们的父亲只能眼睁睁看着他们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their daddy had to watch while these guys… they…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.47,0:02:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那群人都不愿给他个痛快\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they didn't even kill him afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.07,0:02:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让他这么看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just… they just made him watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.84,0:02:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,目睹他女儿被\N{\fnArial\fs30}as his daughters…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.55,0:02:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么把他扔那\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just-just… just left him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.60,0:02:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没碰那两个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but-but… but I didn't touch those girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.35,0:02:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I swear I didn't to…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.44,0:02:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.54,0:02:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你 请相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. You gotta believe me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.90,0:02:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是那种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.53,0:02:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.25,0:02:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 你一定得相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Please, you gotta believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.76,0:03:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你打算怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道计划能让我们安心些\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd all feel better if we knew the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.85,0:03:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有计划吗 - 我们要把他留在这儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is there a plan? - We gonna keep him here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.37,0:03:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快就能知道答案了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll know soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.52,0:03:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有一群人 30个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy there's got a gang, 30 men.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.51,0:03:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有重武装\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have heavy artillery.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.50,0:03:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去可不是什么善类\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they ain't looking to make friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.40,0:03:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们如果来到这里 我们就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They roll through here, our boys are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.88,0:03:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,而女人们会生不如死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And our women, they're gonna… they're gonna wish they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.00,0:03:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对他做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,聊了会天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had a little chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.77,0:03:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都不许接近那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one goes near this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.50,0:03:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 你打算怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.01,0:04:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有选择 他是个威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no choice. He's a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.43,0:04:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能留下后患\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to eliminate the threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.15,0:04:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算就这么杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just gonna kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.82,0:04:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经决定了 我今天就做\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's settled. I'll do it today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.13,0:04:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.55,0:04:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你内心其实是不想的 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't wanna do this. I know you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.63,0:04:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我考虑了一整晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought about it all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.01,0:04:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了新的信息 我觉得这已无法避免\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knowing what we know now, I don't see a way out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.99,0:04:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不能就这么决定他人的生死\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't just decide on your own to take someone's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.09,0:04:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家看上去都很支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}The group seemed supportive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.78,0:04:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为你没给他们机会提出异议\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, because they didn't speak back? You didn't let 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.70,0:04:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须要有一个过程\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be a… a process.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.23,0:04:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么过程 我们不可能搞个审判\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what would that be? We can't call witnesses,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.39,0:04:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,请证人出庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go before a judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.31,0:04:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他就这么被臆断为有罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he's automatically guilty by association.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.37,0:04:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后判处死刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sentenced to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.34,0:04:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.82,0:04:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我跟大家再谈谈 - 我们不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gimme some time to talk to everyone… - We can't…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.46,0:04:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想想有没有其他办法 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …try to figure out another way… - No,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.26,0:04:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can't drag this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.36,0:04:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.45,0:04:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就更需要花时间认真商讨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why they need time to discuss this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.98,0:04:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 他们需要被保护好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, they need to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.85,0:04:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是我的职责 - 你想想你的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I owe 'em that. - You think about your son!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.19,0:05:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想你给他做的榜样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The message that you're giving him…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.47,0:05:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲动行事 不计后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}shoot first, think later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.42,0:05:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只求一天时间 和大家谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking for one day to talk to everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.39,0:05:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以答应的 想想卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can give me that. Think-think about Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.03,0:05:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们日落时集合 做出最终决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We reconvene at sunset, then what happens, happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.47,0:05:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮我个忙 - 你动过武器袋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need a favor. - Did you move the gun bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.19,0:05:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.51,0:05:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你去守着兰德尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to guard Randall,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.25,0:05:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护他安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.09,0:05:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么 - 瑞克给了我时间和大家谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Rick's giving me time to talk to the others,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.80,0:05:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让他们恢复理智\N{\fnArial\fs30}try and talk some sense into them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.45,0:05:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果让肖恩知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if Shane finds out…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.97,0:05:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他会直接杀了那家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think he'd just shoot the guy himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.36,0:05:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道杀这男孩肯定是他的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know killing the boy had to be his idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.09,0:06:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你站在他那边吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you with him on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.84,0:06:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.17,0:06:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我这就是全部弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me this isn't all the ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.80,0:06:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个民事律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a civil rights lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.62,0:06:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 曾是 - 你靠唇枪舌辩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Was. - You fight with words,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.01,0:06:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,以思想为武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}the power of ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.63,0:06:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,用枪是他的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Using a-a gun, that's his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.85,0:06:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真要和我吵这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really want to debate about saving a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.95,0:06:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,放走一个会带人来杀我们的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who will lead his buddies right to our door?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.93,0:06:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是文明社会的道德准则\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what a civilized society does.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.87,0:06:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说这不再是文明社会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who says we're civilized anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 我们熟知的那个世界已经消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the world we knew is gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.74,0:06:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是否保留人性善心\N{\fnArial\fs30}But keeping our humanity?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.41,0:06:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍是我们的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.13,0:06:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你看着囚犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll watch your prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.95,0:06:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这并不代表我认同你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not because I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.03,0:07:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.54,0:07:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.60,0:07:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能喝点水么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get some water?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.80,0:07:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.24,0:07:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我渴死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.32,0:07:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会杀了我 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna kill me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.91,0:07:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说他是个小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he's a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.03,0:07:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不只是个小孩 他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ain't a kid. Just…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.58,0:07:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是一种比喻\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a figure of speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.02,0:07:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能见见他吗 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I see him? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.82,0:07:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这是大人的事 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, this is… this is grown-up stuff, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:08:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你让我们来处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just… you just let us handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.31,0:08:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是戴尔吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.48,0:08:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 派你来做临终看护人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, he put you on death watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.44,0:08:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你 如果我现在要进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you something… say I wanted to go in there right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.24,0:08:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想解决这事 你会阻止我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I just wanted to take care of this, you gonna stop me? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.03,0:08:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我老师很好哦 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I had a good teacher. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.54,0:08:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.43,0:08:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被戴尔的悲情剧场打动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You buy into Dale's sob story?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.34,0:08:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉他这事我站你这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him I was with you on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.21,0:08:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你还是帮着他 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm… You're just still here for him, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.42,0:08:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.96,0:08:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你清楚形势吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see what's happening, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.80,0:08:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这伙人不会同意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guys ain't gonna go through with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.07,0:08:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 他们想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, they gonna…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.97,0:08:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会临阵退缩 如果真这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}they gonna pussy out. And if they do,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.38,0:08:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们麻烦就大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we gonna have a big problem on our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.76,0:08:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you something…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.70,0:08:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次我们遇到麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}every time we have a problem around here,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.90,0:08:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得是谁造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you think's behind it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.38,0:08:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人觉得是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some might say you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.31,0:09:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,才怪 没人听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah. No one listens to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.16,0:09:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得是那几个定规矩的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say it's the guys that make up the rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.62,0:09:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那几个自以为什么都懂的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}the boys that always have all the answers,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.04,0:09:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕事实证明他们是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}even though their answers always prove wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.88,0:09:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你要怎么办 瑞克是头儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are you gonna do? Rick's the leader of this group,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.74,0:09:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 农场又是赫谢尔的 - 也许得改变现状了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's Hershel's farm. - Maybe we oughta change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.36,0:09:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥 你要缴走他们的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you gonna lock 'em in a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.42,0:09:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们锁起来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and take their guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.31,0:09:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 那样形势可能会失控\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. That could get out of hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.04,0:09:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的 我不会让事情失控的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, it won't. Okay? I won't let it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.66,0:09:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不想让任何人受伤 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I don't… I don't want anybody to get hurt, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.90,0:09:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克是我的朋友 我也不讨厌赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick's my friend, Hershel… he's all right by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.86,0:09:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那戴尔呢 - 戴尔虽然很多嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And Dale? - Dale got a big mouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.29,0:09:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他不会伤人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he's harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.85,0:09:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我只是想睡个安稳觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I just… I wanna know what it's like to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.18,0:09:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想整天提心吊胆 这不就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}without keeping one eye open. Ain't that…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.43,0:09:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不就是大家的愿望吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}ain't that what we all want?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.68,0:09:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,主动权在他们手里 或许我是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, ball's in their court. Maybe I'm wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.05,0:09:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,又或许我只是小题大做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'm getting all worked up over nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.46,0:10:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,帽子真帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a sweet hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.52,0:10:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫兰德尔 你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Randall. What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.79,0:10:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那警官是你爸爸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sheriff guy… that your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.49,0:10:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.56,0:10:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 他是个好人 我看得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's a good guy. I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.01,0:10:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈也在这儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom out here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.04,0:10:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真幸运 家人都还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're… you're lucky you still got your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.47,0:10:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去家人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.46,0:10:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不知道他们怎么说我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I… I don't know what people been saying about me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.16,0:10:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我什么坏事都没做 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I didn't do nothing. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.22,0:10:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸本来都要放我走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad was gonna let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.25,0:10:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他和他朋友打了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}till his friend started fighting with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.37,0:10:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时情况很糟 我有点着急\N{\fnArial\fs30}It got pretty bad. I… I was kinda worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.43,0:10:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的营地物资充沛\N{\fnArial\fs30}My camp, we got lots of supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮我 我就带你们一伙人去见我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You help me, I'll take you and your folks back to my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.30,0:10:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会照顾好你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take good care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.21,0:10:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护你们 只要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep you safe. Just gotta…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.40,0:10:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你帮我逃出去 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}just gotta help me get out of here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.54,0:10:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要帮我打开锁 或者找找钥匙好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just help me pick these locks or find the key, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.03,0:11:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我吧 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.26,0:11:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.75,0:11:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿干什么 你跟他说啥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing in here? What did you say to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.90,0:11:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你跟他说啥了 - 我啥也没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did you say to him, huh? - I didn't say nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.78,0:11:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,老子告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you something…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.52,0:11:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老子马上就毙了你 - 好啦 肖恩 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I will shoot you where you sit. - Okay Shane, not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.50,0:11:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 张开嘴 张开嘴 - 肖恩 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Open your mouth. Open your mouth. - Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.14,0:11:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你丫多嘴 让你丫多嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like talking, man? You like talking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.82,0:11:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.23,0:11:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,小兔崽子快出去 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your ass out this door. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.55,0:11:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你搞什么鬼 - 求你别告诉我爸妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The hell you doing? - Please don't tell my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.72,0:11:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 这不好玩 你可能会受伤的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, that ain't cool, man. You could've gotten hurt in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.96,0:11:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能管好自己 - 我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can handle myself. - Let me tell you something…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.84,0:11:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再靠近他 听见没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not go near him again. Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.41,0:11:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈的 - 你不会告诉我爸妈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn it. - You won't tell my parents, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.92,0:11:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, man,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.01,0:11:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是闯祸的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}this isn't about getting in trouble, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.02,0:11:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,像他这种人 什么话都可能说\N{\fnArial\fs30}A guy like that, he will say anything to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.25,0:11:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会让你可怜他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll try to make you feel sorry for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.79,0:11:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会让你降低警惕\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll try to make you get your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.88,0:11:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是降低警惕 就要死人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let your guard down out here, people die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.79,0:11:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, just…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.44,0:11:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我个忙 去把你妈找来 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do me a favor, man… go find your mom. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.95,0:11:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.97,0:11:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再干傻事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}quit trying to get yourself killed, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.61,0:12:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之所以跑到这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole point of me coming up here is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.81,0:12:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是避开你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get away from you people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.51,0:12:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,光这样可躲不开我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna take more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.70,0:12:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔让你来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol send you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.84,0:12:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只卡萝尔关心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol's not the only one that's concerned about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.98,0:12:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你在队伍里的角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}your new role in the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.30,0:12:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不需要心理辅导\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, I don't need my head shrunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.81,0:12:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,队伍早就散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This group's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.36,0:12:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是管好自己吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm better off fending for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.74,0:12:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像不在乎啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You act like you don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.18,0:12:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 因为我是不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's 'cause I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.64,0:12:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你不在乎兰德尔的死活吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So live or die, you don't care what happens to Randall?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.60,0:12:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.40,0:12:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么不和我一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why not stand with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.60,0:12:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,试着去救那孩子的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}try to save the kid's life,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.97,0:12:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然一切都无所谓的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it really doesn't matter one way or the other?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.78,0:12:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让自己显得像个绝望的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't peg you for a desperate son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.85,0:13:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意见会让事情改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your opinion makes a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.71,0:13:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,老头 没人会来找我帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, ain't nobody looking at me for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.89,0:13:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔会 我会 现在就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol is, and I am. Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.01,0:13:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你显然能说服瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you obviously… you have Rick's ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.11,0:13:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克只听肖恩的 随他去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick just looks to Shane. Let him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.94,0:13:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在乎索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cared about what happened to Sofia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.05,0:13:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,在乎她对大伙的意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cared what it meant to the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.20,0:13:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,拷问人 那不是你的作风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Torturing people? That isn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个正直的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a decent man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.54,0:13:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So is Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.83,0:13:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩 他不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane… he's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.63,0:13:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 因为他杀了奥蒂斯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why's that? 'cause he killed Otis?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他告诉你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tell you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.14,0:13:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他撒了谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told some story…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.20,0:13:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,说奥蒂斯掩护他 救了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}how Otis covered him, saved his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.96,0:13:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他却是带着那死人的枪回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He showed up with the dead guy's gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.54,0:13:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克不是傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick ain't stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.50,0:13:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要是没识破 那是因为他不想识破\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he didn't figure that out, it's 'cause he didn't wanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我说的 队伍早散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like I said… group's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.49,0:14:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 你爸呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, where's your daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.31,0:14:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在那儿 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's up there. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.66,0:14:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.19,0:14:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜晚越来越冷 我们又暴露在外\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nights are getting colder and we're pretty exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.30,0:14:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在想… - 也许我们可以清理一下这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was thinking… - Maybe we could clear this place out,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.46,0:14:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这边设个岗哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Station lookouts up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.73,0:14:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们可以和赫谢尔谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we could talk to Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.27,0:14:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们进屋住去\N{\fnArial\fs30}about staying in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.44,0:14:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.89,0:14:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样做是最好的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that really the best way to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.69,0:14:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,非要绞死他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To… string him up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.03,0:15:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.16,0:15:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是头一回\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.49,0:15:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你反对死刑 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know how you feel about the death penalty, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.03,0:15:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道世道变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know the world has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.64,0:15:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,经历了这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything that's happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.83,0:15:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和肖恩达成了共识\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Shane agree on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.19,0:15:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你赞同这个决定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you support this decision?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.16,0:15:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你觉得这样最好的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you think it's best.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.35,0:15:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直没跟我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never did tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.11,0:15:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和肖恩在路上怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}what happened on the road with you and Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.47,0:15:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会再找麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't be a problem anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.68,0:15:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会在天堂和索菲亚重逢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we'll see Sophia again in heaven some day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.45,0:15:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她去了更好的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's in a better place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.47,0:15:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.34,0:15:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂只是骗人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven is just another lie,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.92,0:16:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你相信 你就是傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if you believe it, you're an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.75,0:16:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得管管你家孩子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to control that boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.82,0:16:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.68,0:16:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他大不敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's disrespectful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.61,0:16:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说啥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.76,0:16:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,说了些对不起索菲亚的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something cruel about Sofia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.74,0:16:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们会管教他的 没关系 - 有关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll figure it out. It's okay. I… - It's not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.98,0:16:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会 我会找他谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have… I'll have a talk with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.83,0:16:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 我们会\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? We'll… we'll…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.83,0:16:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会管教他的 你冷静点 我才能\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll deal with it. If you can calm down, so that I can…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.99,0:16:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别叫我冷静 - 不 我不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't tell me to calm down! - No, I… I don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.02,0:16:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要你可怜我 大家要么躲着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need you to patronize me. Everyone either avoids me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.76,0:16:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么就当我是疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}or they treat me like I'm crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.88,0:16:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是失去了女儿 可我没失去理智\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost my daughter. I didn't lose my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.27,0:16:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, come over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.66,0:16:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你冲卡萝尔顶嘴了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you talk back to Carol?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.55,0:16:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 她说你有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - She says you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.02,0:16:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能这么跟别人说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't talk back to people like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.41,0:17:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 相信天堂的人是傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said it's stupid to believe in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.85,0:17:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.77,0:17:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再仔细想一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, just think about that for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.77,0:17:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她刚失去了女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just lost her daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.95,0:17:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她希望她女儿在另外一个地方快乐地活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants to believe she's still alive in some way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.40,0:17:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是她 - 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But she… - Don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.34,0:17:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,少说话 多思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk. Think.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.39,0:17:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是经验之谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good rule of thumb for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.20,0:17:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈总是希望你能多说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom always wants you to talk more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.46,0:17:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要改变话题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't change the subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.75,0:17:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该向卡萝尔道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe Carol an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.64,0:17:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你犯了错 要想办法弥补\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made a mistake. Fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.53,0:17:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你要杀那个人的原因吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why you're gonna kill that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.50,0:17:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,弥补自己犯下的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fixing your mistake?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.91,0:17:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.60,0:17:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎么做 把他吊死在谷仓里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you gonna do it? Are you gonna hang him in the barn?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.82,0:17:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需要处理好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just think about how.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.63,0:17:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己和卡萝尔的事情就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna make things right with Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.70,0:17:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,少说话 多思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk. Think.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.48,0:17:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白吗 - 明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.51,0:17:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 一群牛挤倒栅栏跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - A dozen steer busted through the fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.67,0:18:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了跑掉的牛吵了一早晨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been wrangling the runaways all morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.33,0:18:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是来和我讨论牛的事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not here to talk cattle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.11,0:18:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个孩子 - 那个犯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The boy. - The prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.01,0:18:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 兰德尔 - 我不想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Randall. - I don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.47,0:18:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家会决定他的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm told they're deciding his fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.89,0:18:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克负责就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll leave it with Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.43,0:18:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是你的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is your home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.06,0:18:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想让他离我女儿们远远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want him away from my girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.76,0:18:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎怎么做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care how.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.20,0:18:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是赤裸裸的处刑 - 我不想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's an execution. - I don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.59,0:18:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你不能袖手旁观\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't stand by the sidelines.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.76,0:18:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是有信念的人 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a man with convictions. You…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.28,0:18:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你说实话吧 我以前是\N{\fnArial\fs30}To tell you the truth, I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.27,0:18:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我以为我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or at least I thought I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.51,0:18:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我犯了太多错\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've made too many mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.48,0:18:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你做决定之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you at least talk with Randall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.83,0:18:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你至少应该和兰德尔谈谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}before making up your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.51,0:18:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 让瑞克全权负责吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'll leave it with Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.33,0:21:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, Dale?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.01,0:21:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让你改个主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna change your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.66,0:21:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是认真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}what, you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.68,0:21:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道咱们俩不可能看法完全一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you and I will never see eye to eye on much…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.15,0:22:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得真轻描淡写\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say that's the understatement of the year, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.20,0:22:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.17,0:22:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你哪也不去 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you're not going anywhere… - Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.76,0:22:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也哪都不去 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …and I'm not going anywhere. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.42,0:22:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们像男人一样说说这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's talk about this like men.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.06,0:22:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.46,0:22:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们没有身处危险之中吗 戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You deny we're in danger, Dale?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.45,0:22:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 但是我们人多势众\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but there's a dozen of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.01,0:22:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他势单力薄\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.43,0:22:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有30个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's 30 of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.44,0:22:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀掉他也改变不了这个事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing him doesn't change that…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.33,0:22:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会 - 但是会改变我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - But it changes us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.86,0:22:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.18,0:22:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有胆量 戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}you got balls, Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.19,0:22:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.41,0:22:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.92,0:22:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 等会大家讨论这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what… in a little bit, when y'all gather,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.19,0:22:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会表达自己的观点\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.66,0:22:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你说服了大家放过这个家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you've convinced them to keep this guy alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.96,0:22:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有意见 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I ain't gonna say a damn word about it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.57,0:22:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我直接告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm telling you now, man to man,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.92,0:22:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.95,0:23:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这个家伙日后杀了人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when this guy kills somebody,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.37,0:23:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都不用说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't gonna need to say anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.63,0:23:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那笔血账一定会算在你头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}because that blood… that's gonna be on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.83,0:23:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了 戴尔 大错特错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong about this, Dale. You're dead wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.16,0:23:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,小虫小虫快飞吧 快快飞回你的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doodlebug, doodlebug, go away home.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.42,0:23:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,小虫虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doodlebug.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.00,0:23:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,小虫小虫快飞吧 快快飞回你的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doodlebug, doodlebug, go away home.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.73,0:23:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她怎么样了 - 今天看起来精神不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How is she? - She seems to be in good spirits today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.80,0:23:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是呀 小虫虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you, doodlebug?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.64,0:23:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果需要我的话就尽管说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let me know if I can do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.44,0:23:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你家从哪来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your family from?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.64,0:23:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,密歇根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michigan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.40,0:23:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之前是在韩国\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, before that, Korea.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.19,0:23:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,移民建造了这个国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Immigrants built this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.77,0:24:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不要忘了这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.38,0:24:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们家是从爱尔兰来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our family came from Ireland.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.85,0:24:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬·格林 我感觉也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie Greene… I kinda figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.23,0:24:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祖父把这个从家乡带过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandfather brought this over from the old country.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.64,0:24:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,传给了我爸爸 又传给了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He passed it on to my father, who passed it on to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.87,0:24:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天我把它当了买酒喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pawned it to pay for a night of drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.02,0:24:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得是哪天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I no longer remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.88,0:24:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把它买了回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bought it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.49,0:24:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第二任妻子买回来的 约瑟芬\N{\fnArial\fs30}My late wife did… Josephine,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.10,0:24:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.61,0:24:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年之后我戒了酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}She gave it back years later.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.49,0:24:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她又还给了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I sobered up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.20,0:24:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的约瑟芬 她是个好女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a good woman, my Jo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.62,0:24:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬很像她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie's a lot like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.22,0:24:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在那个酒吧的时候 还有回来之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we were in that bar and afterwards,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.84,0:24:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought about a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.19,0:24:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天你也会成为父亲 你会明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You become a father someday, you'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.48,0:24:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人能配得上自己的小女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No man is good enough for your little girl…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.49,0:25:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到那个人出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}until one is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.80,0:25:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,送给你 别让我改变对你的印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}You own it now, before I change my mind about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.40,0:25:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.14,0:25:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.21,0:25:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道对于你来说这不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this isn't easy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.39,0:25:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,对谁来说都不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't easy for anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.48,0:25:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我仔细想过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I thought it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.20,0:25:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.78,0:25:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.15,0:25:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必亲自动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to be the one to do it…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.78,0:25:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖恩 达里尔都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane, Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.96,0:25:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 就得是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it has to be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.93,0:25:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把他带回来的 也许我不应该这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought him back here. Maybe I shouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.82,0:25:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须确保这些人的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta keep these people safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.61,0:26:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我要做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is what I'm gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.21,0:26:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那戴尔怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Dale?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.70,0:26:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直在努力说服大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got an uphill battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.27,0:26:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说过你支持我 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You said you support me. - I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.03,0:26:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你不认为这是正确的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't say you think I'm making the right call.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.30,0:26:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是正确的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the right call.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.34,0:27:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,集合吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's gather up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.62,0:27:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来 卡尔 你去和吉米呆在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Carl. I want you to stay with Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.86,0:27:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我想参加\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I wanna listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.67,0:27:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次不行 快去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hm-mmm, not this time. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.40,0:28:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么做 投票表决吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how do we do this? Just take a vote?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.18,0:28:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,全票通过才行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it have to be unanimous?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.79,0:28:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,少数服从多数怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about majority rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.88,0:28:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先看看大家的意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's… let's just see where everybody stands,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.11,0:28:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再做决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we can talk through the options.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.14,0:28:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意见是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, where I sit,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.14,0:28:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's only one way to move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.78,0:28:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.12,0:28:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们根本不用投票\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, why even bother to even take a vote?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.66,0:28:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家的意见显而易见\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's clear which way the wind's blowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.92,0:28:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人认为我们应该放过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if people believe we should spare him,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.03,0:28:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.18,0:28:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以告诉你只有一小波人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can tell you it's a small group…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.30,0:28:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能只有我和格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe just me and Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.64,0:28:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.61,0:29:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道在很多事情上你的看法都很对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're pretty much right about everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.88,0:29:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直都是 但是这次\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the time, but this…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.50,0:29:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都让你害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got you scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.98,0:29:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是我们中的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.19,0:29:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经失去了很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we've… we've lost too many people already.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.78,0:29:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 你同意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you? Do you agree with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.39,0:29:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能继续关着他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't we continue keeping him prisoner?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.69,0:29:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又多了一张嘴吃饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just another mouth to feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.61,0:29:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个冬天我们可能粮食减产\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may be a lean winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.57,0:29:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以更好地规划一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could ration better.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.41,0:29:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能有利用价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he could be an asset.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.73,0:29:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他个机会让他证明一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him a chance to prove himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.14,0:29:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他去干活吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put him to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.02,0:29:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能让他随意走动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not letting him walk around.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.65,0:29:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以找个人看着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could put an escort on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.15,0:29:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁愿意去呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wants to volunteer for that duty?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.85,0:29:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去 - 我认为我们谁都不应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I will. - I don't think any of us should be walking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.17,0:29:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 和他呆在一起 - 他说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- with this guy. - He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.45,0:29:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他绑起来我才觉得安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't feel safe unless he was tied up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.11,0:29:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么能真的给他上脚镣\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't exactly put chains around his ankles,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.11,0:29:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,判他去做苦力\N{\fnArial\fs30}sentence him to hard labor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.04,0:29:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 如果我们让他加入我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, say we let him join us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.88,0:29:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他能帮忙 也许他人很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's helpful, maybe he's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.73,0:29:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会放松警惕 他就可能逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We let our guard down and maybe he runs off,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.74,0:29:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,带回来30个他们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}brings back his 30 men.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.78,0:30:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以杀他的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the answer is to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.22,0:30:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是去阻止他也许永远不会犯的罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}to prevent a crime that he may never even attempt?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.87,0:30:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.70,0:30:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就代表了没有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're saying there's no hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.33,0:30:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有法律 没有文明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rule of law is dead. There is no civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.83,0:30:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.84,0:30:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能开车把他送的更远一点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you drive him further out?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.86,0:30:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,像之前计划的一样丢下他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave him like you planned?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.23,0:30:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这次都差点没能回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You barely came back this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.50,0:30:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是行尸 你会被干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are walkers. You could break down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.08,0:30:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会迷路 - 或者中埋伏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Y-you could get lost. - Or get ambushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.34,0:30:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说的对 我们不能让自己人冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're right. We should not put our own people at risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.46,0:30:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果真要杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you go through with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.16,0:30:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.24,0:30:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死前会受苦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would he suffer?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.22,0:30:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以吊死他 勒断他的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could hang him, right? Just snap his neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.02,0:30:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我考虑过那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.26,0:30:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,用枪也许更人性点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shooting may be more humane.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.58,0:30:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体怎么处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about the body?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.73,0:30:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们埋他吗 - 等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do we bury him? - Hold on, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.67,0:30:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们说得好像已经决定了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're talking about this like it's already decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.67,0:30:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经商量了一整天 没有什么实质进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been talking all day, going around in circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.85,0:30:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还准备继续浪费时间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just wanna go around in circles again?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.42,0:31:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个年轻人的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a young man's life,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.23,0:31:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么能只谈5分钟呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it is worth more than a five-minute conversation!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.83,0:31:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在都变成这样了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this what it's come to?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.88,0:31:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道该拿他怎么办 就直接杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We kill someone because we can't decide what else to do with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.90,0:31:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.54,0:31:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但看看我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now look at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.91,0:31:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被折磨 还会被处死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been tortured. He's gonna be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.35,0:31:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们比那些我们害怕的家伙能好多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we any better than those people that we're so afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.70,0:31:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道这是必须做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all know what needs to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.29,0:31:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 戴尔是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dale is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.80,0:31:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能草率决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't leave any stone unturned here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.86,0:31:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们有负责 - 还有别的办法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have a responsibility… - so what's the other solution?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.69,0:31:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让瑞克说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let Rick finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.80,0:31:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到现在还没想出一个可行的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't come up with a single viable option yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.50,0:31:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我希望我们可以 - 那就再想想啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wish we could. - So let's work on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.98,0:31:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们会的 - 别说了 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We are. - Stop it. Just stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.09,0:31:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够所有人的争论和争吵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sick of everybody arguing and fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.75,0:31:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't ask for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.24,0:31:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能让我们在这种事上做选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't ask us to decide something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.78,0:32:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们决定吧 你们俩谁都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please decide… either of you, both of you…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.50,0:32:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但别把我算进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}but leave me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.51,0:32:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不为他辩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not speaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.64,0:32:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,和亲手杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}or killing him yourself…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.04,0:32:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有什么区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's no difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.00,0:32:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.62,0:32:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人都有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody who wants the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.95,0:32:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们做出最终决定前\N{\fnArial\fs30}before we make a final decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.82,0:32:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,提出异议\N{\fnArial\fs30}has the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.23,0:32:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾经说过我们不会杀活人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You once said that we don't kill the living.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.80,0:32:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是在别人想杀我们之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was before the living tried to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.19,0:32:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道不明白吗 如果我们这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't you see? If we do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.07,0:32:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}the people that we were…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.64,0:32:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我们所认知的世界将会崩塌\N{\fnArial\fs30}the world that we knew is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.90,0:32:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个新世界很丑陋\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this new world is ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.32,0:32:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,很…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.73,0:32:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,残酷 是适者生存的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}harsh. It's… it's survival of the fittest.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.44,0:32:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不愿活在那样的世界中\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's a world I don't wanna live in,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.67,0:32:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你们也不愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I don't… and I don't believe that any of you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.85,0:33:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.28,0:33:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.95,0:33:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让我们做对的事情吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just do what's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.21,0:33:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道没有人支持我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't there anybody else who's gonna stand with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.74,0:33:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.64,0:33:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该想想另外的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should try to find another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.98,0:33:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody else?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.47,0:33:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是不是还准备观看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are y'all gonna watch, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.24,0:34:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你们会躲在帐篷里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you'll go hide your heads in your tents.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.66,0:34:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,试着忘记我们杀了一个活生生的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and try to forget that we're slaughtering a human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.33,0:34:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想参与\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't be a party to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.72,0:34:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个队伍确实散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This group is broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.85,0:34:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on. Hold on. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.96,0:34:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.23,0:34:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 把他放在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ah. - Put him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.81,0:34:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿嘿 - 很快会结束的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- hey-hey! - It's all gonna be over soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.54,0:34:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么会很快结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What's gonna be over soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.77,0:35:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放松 - 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Relax. - Hey… hey. No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.51,0:35:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.42,0:35:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no… no.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.91,0:35:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想站着还是跪着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to stand or kneel?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.76,0:35:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.98,0:35:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ple… ah-ah-ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.92,0:35:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么遗言吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any final words?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.23,0:35:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.42,0:35:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了不要 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't. Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.78,0:36:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,下手 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it, dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.67,0:36:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,下手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.22,0:36:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑 我怎么给你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me? What'd I say to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.60,0:36:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么给你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I say to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.11,0:36:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.97,0:36:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.43,0:36:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 站起来 - 啊啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get up. - Ah. Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.55,0:37:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们暂时把他关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're keeping him in custody, for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.60,0:37:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna find Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.30,0:37:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 进屋去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.25,0:37:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.81,0:37:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟我们来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He followed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.86,0:37:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.45,0:37:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不能… - 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I couldn't… - That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.96,0:37:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.57,0:39:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看着卡尔 - 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get Carl. - Baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.55,0:39:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生了什么 - 过来 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - Come here. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.04,0:39:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,T仔 快去拿把猎枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-dog, get a shotgun now!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.09,0:39:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你进屋去 锁上门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to go in the house, I want you to lock the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.74,0:39:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要你待在房子里 - 好的 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and I want you to stay inside. - Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.25,0:39:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.15,0:39:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生了什么 - 我不知道 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - I don't know… go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.82,0:39:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.45,0:39:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.51,0:40:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊 在这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.81,0:40:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救命啊 快点 坚持住老兄 - 是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help! Run! Hang in there, buddy. - Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.91,0:40:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god. Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.61,0:40:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瑞克 - 好了 把注意力集中在我声音上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rick! - All right, just listen to my voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.19,0:40:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我的声音好吗 听我的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, all right? Just listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.89,0:40:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 坚持住 叫赫谢尔来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, hold on now. Get Hershel!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.65,0:40:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他需要输血 必须立刻处理 - 坚持住 戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He needs blood. We gotta operate now. - Hang on, Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.45,0:40:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.70,0:40:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.69,0:40:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意力集中在我声音上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on… okay, just listen to my voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.66,0:40:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 快点 赫谢尔 我们需要赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, please. Hershel! We need Hershel!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.62,0:40:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看着我 - 戴尔 我们会帮你的 有我们在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look at me. - Dale, we're gonna help. We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.54,0:40:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一定要坚持住 - 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just hold on… hold on. - What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.71,0:40:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们能做什么 - 戴尔 一切都会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What can we do? - Dale, it's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.60,0:40:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们能转移他吗 - 他没法承受颠簸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can we move him? - He won't make the trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.07,0:40:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须在这里治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to do the operation here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.86,0:40:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格伦 回屋子去拿… - 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Glenn, get back to the house… - Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.45,0:40:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.17,0:40:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.30,0:41:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.64,0:41:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.68,0:41:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.48,0:41:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.90,0:42:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, brother.
